OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted for performance
OL,4,Aspace and park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted to build a
OL,7,Fpark and performance space on the bank
OL,8,Fof a river.
OL,10,FGateshead Council has announced the
OL,11,Fdevelopment proposal for Gateshead
OL,12,FQuays, next to the Glasshouse
OL,13,FInternational Centre for Music, which
OL,14,Falso includes a plaza and improved
OL,15,Fpedestrian access.
OL,17,FBoth Reform UK councillor Steve Campion
OL,18,Fand North East mayor Kim McGuinness
OL,19,Fsaid this was the first phase in the
OL,20,Fredevelopment which will prepare the
OL,21,Fsite for the proposed new arena.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
